stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Opened : open(/sys/kernel/debug/kcov_dataflow)
    Opened --> Initialised : KCOV_DF_INIT_TRACK(words)
    Initialised --> Mapped : mmap(size * 8)
    Mapped --> Local : KCOV_DF_ENABLE
    Local --> Mapped : KCOV_DF_DISABLE
    Mapped --> Published : KCOV_DF_REMOTE_ENABLE(&handle)
    Published --> Mapped : KCOV_DF_REMOTE_DISABLE
    Local --> [*] : task exit / close
    Mapped --> [*] : close
    Published --> [*] : close
    note right of Local
      exactly one writer:
      plain area[0] update
    end note
    note right of Published
      many kworkers:
      private scratch, then
      atomic cmpxchg merge
    end note
